keywords: [digital thread, digital twin, zero trust, industrial cybersecurity, data provenance, post-quantum cryptography, Monte Carlo simulation, model checking]
abstract: >-
  Code, configurations, seeds, raw and processed data, notebook, bounded model-checking logs and a software proof of
  concept for ZTAS-DTh, a lifecycle-spanning zero-trust security architecture for the digital thread. The evidence is
  simulation- and benchmark-based; no industrial deployment is included.
